O(1D) + CH3OH => CH2OH + OH                  !  2.99d-10
O(1D) + CH3OH => HOCHO + H + H               !  8.97d-11
# D.S. Stafford, et al, J. Appl. Phys. 96 (5) (2004) 2451-2465.	
O(1D) + HE => O + HE	                     !  1.0d-13
