HE* + CH4 => HE + CH2 + H + H                !  3.3d-10
HE* + CH4 => HE + CH + H + H2                !  5.8d-11
HE* + CH4 => HE + CH3 + H                    !  5.8d-11
HE* + CH4 => HE + CH2 + H2                   !  5.8d-10
