HE* + O2 => HE + O + O(1S)                   !  1.6d-10
HE* + O2 => HE + O + O(1D)                   !  1.7d-10

# D.S. Stafford, et al, J. Appl. Phys. 96 (5) (2004) 2451-2465.
E + HE^+ => HE*                         !  6.76d-13*Te**-0.5
E + E + HE^+ => HE* + E                 !  5.12d-27*Te**-4.5
HE^+ + O2 => O2^+ + HE 	    	        !  3.30d-11*(Tgas/300.0d0)**0.5
HE^+ + O2(B1) => O2^+ + HE       	!  3.30d-11*(Tgas/300.0d0)**0.5

# A. Starikovskiy, N. Aleksandrov, Mechanism of Plasma-Assisted Ignition for H2 and C1-C5 Hydrocarbons, 55th AIAA Aerospace Sciences Meeting, 2017.
